title: "PIVOT: From seeing a room to proving how to change it"
abstract: >-
  Verified spatial reasoning: a Muse or Llama agent answers questions about a real
  room, scanned and segmented with SAM 3.1, only with what geometric tools computed
  (collisions, paths, passages). Built for the Meta Global AI Hackathon 2026.
